hpc:Computeunit a owl:Class .
hpc:type a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Computeunit ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:member a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Computeunit ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Computeunit .

hpc:excludedmember a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Computeunit ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:Finestgranularity a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Computeunit .

hpc:Coarsergranularity a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Computeunit .

hpc:retrievewithegroup a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Finestgranularity ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .


For the special characters usage, it would be better to create a separate vocabulary to handle them, but since it's not explicitly asked for in the documentation, I've omitted it.
